by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Users on older versions of Copilot Chat see an increased number of chat messages failing with `Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'split')`. If your error traces show _github.copilot-chat-**0.11.1**_ you are **NOT** on the latest version.\r\n\r\n⚠️ Both VS Code and the extension need to be updated, as the latest release of Copilot Chat requires the latest release of VS Code.\r\n\r\nDouble-check you have **VS Code 1.86** and **Copilot Chat 0.12** and there are no blue notification dots for _Restart to update_!\r\n\r\nUpdate your VS Code (Command: Check for Updates...) + Copilot Chat extension (Command: Extensions: Update All Extensions). **Close and re-open VS Code** just to make sure, as this applies any pending updates.\r\n\r\n**Common update blockers:**\r\n- Auto-updates disabled: Check settings `extensions.autoCheckUpdates` and `update.mode`\r\n- Running VS Code as administrator will prevent updates: Don't run as administrator.\r\n- Running it directly from macOS' _Downloads_ folder (read-only): Drag the VS Code app to _Applications_ folder.\r\n- Legacy version with updates disabled on enterprise managed machine: Re-install if you have the rights or check with IT.\r\n\r\nIf you can't update, please share what blocks you from updating here so we can better understand and improve this process in the future.","closed_by":{"login":"dmitrivMS","id":9581278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1ODEyNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9581278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS","html_url":"https://github.com/dmitrivMS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u